## Linear Birefringence
*Orienting an unknown tetragonal sample with strong linear birefringence*

Load the test data measured in four different polarizer–analyzer configurations:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## Linear Birefringence
*Orienting an unknown tetragonal sample with strong linear birefringence*

Load the test data measured in four different polarizer–analyzer configurations:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
testData = NotebookRead[NotebookStore["bootes-1e7"]];
{listSam, listRef} = testData;

listSam // Shallow  
listRef // Shallow  

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
{{Times[1/4, Pi], 0} -> QuantityArray[...], {Times[1/2, Pi], Times[1/2, Pi]} -> QuantityArray[...], {Times[1/4, Pi], Times[1/2, Pi]} -> QuantityArray[...], {0, 0} -> QuantityArray[...]}

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
{{Times[1/4, Pi], 0} -> QuantityArray[...], {Times[1/4, Pi], Times[1/2, Pi]} -> QuantityArray[...], {Times[1/2, Pi], Times[1/2, Pi]} -> QuantityArray[...], {0, 0} -> QuantityArray[...]}

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
