.md
The `JonesMatrix` constructor accepts two lists containing the sample and reference data sets:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
The `JonesMatrix` constructor accepts two lists containing the sample and reference data sets:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
d = JonesMatrix[listSam, listRef]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
(*VB[*)BoxForm`temporalStorage$327162(*,*)(*"1:"*)(*]VB*)

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Now, `d` contains a series of Jones matrices—one for each measured frequency—rather than a single matrix. We can extract the matrix at a specific frequency:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Now, `d` contains a series of Jones matrices—one for each measured frequency—rather than a single matrix. We can extract the matrix at a specific frequency:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
d[Quantity[1.25, "Terahertz"]] // MatrixForm 

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
(*GB[*){{0.5963015865631917` -0.05208772491777156` I(*|*),(*|*)0.09143847094395247` -0.03082360560322146` I}(*||*),(*||*){-0.06687365647459285`+0.09671165603605036` I(*|*),(*|*)-0.203333895979706`-0.7882630234360012` I}}(*||*)(*1:eJxTTMoPSmNkYGAo5gUSYZmp5S6pyflFiSX5RcFsQBHfxJKizAoAs04KOA==*)(*]GB*)

