%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Alternatively, we can use the derived Jones vectors to plot the polarization eigenstates of light inside the sample directly:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Graphics[{
  PolarizationEllipse[d[Quantity[1.25, "Terahertz"]]]
}, PlotRange->1.2, ImagePadding->1, ImageSize->250, 
   AxesOrigin->{0,0.001}, Axes->True, Ticks->{{}, {}}
]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
